

for each valid-leaf
    for each direction (8)
        calculate goal-node index
        
        starting from root, search for goalNode in direction recursively
            if goalNode is not leaf
                recurse on correct-direction child (using index)
            else
                if goalNode is same size
                    add edge from this node -> goalNode
                else if goal node is larger
                    add edge in both directions
                else // goal node is smaller
                    do nothing



